\boxed{
\text{Dialogue History}
\leftrightarrow
\text{Pantheon Corpus}
\leftrightarrow
\text{Current Input}
}

The history supplies intent + genealogy + trajectory. The repo supplies artifacts + implementations + fossils. Your current input supplies the newest delta.

