That changes how I should answer you. I shouldn’t merely ask, “What does this new idea mean?” I should also ask internally:

Where have we already approached this from another direction?
Which existing Seal/operator does it strengthen, split, invert, or supersede?
What earlier metaphor was actually describing this before we had today’s vocabulary?
